# Public URL of the RideWing API.
#
# Anything prefixed with EXPO_PUBLIC_ is inlined into the JS bundle, so never put
# a secret here. The backend holds every credential.
#
# This is the DEFAULT only — it can be changed at runtime from Settings -> Server
# (with a "Test & save" button), which is the escape hatch when this is wrong for
# the device you are on.
#
# Deployed API:
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://ridewing.onrender.com
#
# Local development, if you run the API yourself (from the repo root):
#   iOS simulator      http://localhost:4000
#   Android emulator   http://10.0.2.2:4000   (10.0.2.2 is the host, not localhost)
#   Physical device    http://<your-LAN-IP>:4000  (same Wi-Fi; find it with `ip addr`)
#
# Starting a local API:  npm run dev:backend
# Checking the contract:  npm run check:api
